; --- svchost group (SOFTWARE hive) ---
; TermService runs in the DcomLaunch svchost group, as it does on a real XP (that svchost instance
; is already running in the PE). This overwrites the group's member list to include both.
[Software.AddReg]
0x7,"Microsoft\Windows NT\CurrentVersion\Svchost","DcomLaunch","DcomLaunch","TermService"
